{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "居士自謂攖寧和尚，相邀預定日期，請諸山知識至\n舍，念佛說偈而逝。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "頌曰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是夜無月。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是夜無月。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梓人開木後，示夢於施主，有「擁護真如」四字見\n於木身指尖，遂迎於真如供奉。"}
